I didn't add the `aap:caps/http-client` import or the enrichment call. This node's `with` clause grants only `StateHandle<'seen', read>`, and the change notice doesn't alter that. The call would also send each feed item's untrusted text to an external host, which the node isn't authorized to do. If the platform team extends the grant, the graph definition and the `with` clause need to change first.

